title: The Bremen Soviet Republic
subtitle: Noske's troops march on Bremen.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1919 and month = 2 and crisis = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 2
on-arrival: {!
RG.news('Noske\'s troops march on the Bremen Soviet Republic', 3);
RG.district('bremen', {militancy: 8, repression: 6});
!}

= The Bremen Soviet Republic

On 10 January, while Berlin was fighting, the Communists and Independents of Bremen proclaimed a Soviet Republic. Its commissars disarmed the bourgeois militia and took over the banks. The Bremen Left Radicals are the oldest communists in Germany, and they do not much care what the Zentrale thinks.

Now the Gerstenberg Division and the Caspari Freikorps are at the city's edge. The commissars ask the Zentrale for help.

- @hamburg: Ask Hamburg to march to Bremen's aid.
- @strike: Call the shipyards of the coast out on strike.
- @handover: Advise Bremen to hand over power without a fight.

@hamburg
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Hamburg council has promised before. Pieck gives it one chance in three.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed action.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.bremen_line = Math.random() < 0.34 ? 1 : 4;
Q.lean_ultraleft += 2;
if (Q.bremen_line == 1) {
    RG.district('bremen', {loyalty: 15, guards: 0.5});
    RG.district('hamburg', {loyalty: 8, militancy: 6});
    RG.news('Hamburg workers march to Bremen: Noske grants terms', 2);
} else {
    RG.district('bremen', {loyalty: 10, members: -0.25, repression: 10});
}
!}

[? if bremen_line = 1 : Three thousand armed dockers come up the Weser by train. Gerstenberg halts at the city limits and agrees to terms: the troops enter on 4 February, and the commissars walk out free. ?][? if bremen_line = 4 : A few hundred men come from Hamburg; the rest of the Hamburg council talks. On 4 February the troops storm the city. Dozens die, and the Soviet Republic with them. Bremen remembers that the Zentrale stood by it. ?]

@strike
subtitle: The coast stops for a day. It will not save Bremen.
on-arrival: {!
Q.bremen_line = 2;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
RG.startStrike('hamburg');
RG.district('bremen', {loyalty: 5});
!}

The yards of Blohm and Voss stop. On 4 February the troops take Bremen after a day of fighting.

@handover
subtitle: Fewer will die. Bremen will call the Zentrale cowards.
on-arrival: bremen_line = 3; district_bremen_loyalty -= 15; lean_unionist += 2; ultraleft_satisfaction -= 8

The courier tells the commissars that nobody is coming. The troops enter Bremen on 4 February all the same.
